                "title": "Ornate Floral Leverset",
                "description": "Fit for royalty, this Fancy Floral Door Lever features luxurious embellishments on the handle. This Floral Lever is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Ornate Floral Leverset is available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.\r\n",
